## PR Description

Closes #395
### What changed
Added `dmtools upgrade [version]` (alias `update`) and the runtime form `mcp upgrade` / `mcp update`, so installs with an old launcher can still reach it. Downloads the release `install.sh` and runs it with the version.

### Key decisions
- Version must match `1.2.3` / `v1.2.3`; rejected before any download or execution.
- Failed download runs nothing (exit 1); failing installer returns its exit code.
- `DMTOOLS_UPGRADE_DRY_RUN=true` prints the plan and changes nothing.
- The `mcp` key only intercepts `upgrade`/`update`; other `mcp ...` input still goes to the tool dispatcher.
- No GraalJS in this repo (`grep -i graal|truffle` over lib, bin, pubspec: none; JS engine is QuickJS), so the TruffleAttach flag does not apply. Nothing to add there.

### How to verify
```bash
dart test test/cli/upgrade_command_test.dart test/cli/cli_dispatcher_test.dart
```

